  "description": "Collection of 10 seamless vector patterns. Diagonal bricks, striped shapes. Geometric monochrome backgrounds. Digital paper. Scrapbook paper. Repeating geometric tiles with diagonaly arranged filled bricks, shapes, tiles.\nYou can use seamless patterns as backgrounds, fabric print, surface textures, wrapping paper, cloth design, banners, business cards, posters, web page backdrops and more.\nSet contains:\n10 AI format vector files\n10 EPS format vector files\n10 JPG files (3600x3600px, 300dpi)\n10 PNG files (3600x3600px, 300dpi)\n10 Transparent PNG files (3600x3600px, 300dpi)\n1 AI file, 1 EPS(10) file with all 10 patterns (10 Pattern swatches included).\nEach pattern are in separate folder.\nAll patterns are seamless, edited, repeated, tileable. All patterns with source swatch (swatch panel)\n—Please note that this is a digital download only, no physical product will be shipped!! Mockups are not included—\nThanks for visiting our shop!",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Collection of 10 seamless vector patterns. Diagonal bricks, striped shapes. Geometric monochrome backgrounds. Digital paper. Scrapbook paper. Repeating geometric tiles with diagonaly arranged filled bricks, shapes, tiles.</p>\n<p>You can use seamless patterns as backgrounds, fabric print, surface textures, wrapping paper, cloth design, banners, business cards, posters, web page backdrops and more.</p>\n<p>Set contains:<br>\n10 AI format vector files<br>\n10 EPS format vector files<br>\n10 JPG files (3600x3600px, 300dpi)<br>\n10 PNG files (3600x3600px, 300dpi)<br>\n10 Transparent PNG files (3600x3600px, 300dpi)<br>\n1 AI file, 1 EPS(10) file with all 10 patterns (10 Pattern swatches included).</p>\n<p>Each pattern are in separate folder.</p>\n<p>All patterns are seamless, edited, repeated, tileable. All patterns with source swatch (swatch panel)</p>\n<p>—Please note that this is a digital download only, no physical product will be shipped!! Mockups are not included—</p>\n<p>Thanks for visiting our shop!</p>",
